{
  "_comment": [
    "Read by tools/test_plan.py for `tools/godot.sh test --gate|--tier=...` (docs/PERFORMANCE_AUDIT.md, 3.2).",
    "Tiers: gate = every suite not listed in `slow` or `medium`, plus the suites the changed files map to;",
    "merge = everything but `slow`, plus the mapped suites; full = everything. Suite names are file stems",
    "in tests/suites without 'test_'. Times are from a native run on the owner's 6-CPU machine (October 2026);",
    "move a suite between the lists when its time changes, and list a new slow suite here or it lands in gate.",
    "`rules` are matched in order against each changed path (shell-style globs); `suites` are suite-name",
    "globs, `tier` raises the plan's tier. A path no rule matches is matched by name instead: the file's",
    "stem and its parent folders under scripts/ or data/ against suite names on '_' boundaries (so",
    "scripts/enemies/resonator.gd runs resonator, scripts/bosses/the_house/* runs the_house*, and",
    "scripts/world/skins/golden/* runs golden_skin and golden_palace_skin). A script under scripts/ that",
    "matches nothing raises the tier to merge."
  ],
